<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Radio started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cox Radio started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Cox Radio Inc with an &quot;outperform significantly&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Cox Radio gained 5/8 to 20-1/2.</p>
</text>
